	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentinae</placeName> 16. octobris 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Salutem in domino nostro Iesu Christo perpetuam!</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Duplici nomine multum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>exhilararunt me tuae literae, <persName ref="p495">Bul[l]ingere</persName> amice et domine colende, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>tum quod cum tuis valeres meique haud immemor esses, tum quod <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><persName>Ioannis</persName> affinis meus ex ceptis bonis omnibus sit acceptus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ego <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>admonitione non indigebo, quo satisfaciat vestrae expectationi.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Preter segnities nihil iuveni nocebit; isque mmorbus vobis cognitus <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>facile medebitur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Viixit apud me honestissime olim, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>magnamque praebuit spem viri futuri boni; in quem ut evadat, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Deum Optimum Maximum praecor.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Fama de novo tumultu in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> falsissima est: nam ante <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>octiduum accepi per veredarium literas ab amico nostro D. <persName ref="p1548">Richardo</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>datas 18 septembris, <placeName ref="l296">Londini</placeName>; item alias ab <placeName ref="l15">Andwerpia</placeName> 28 se<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ptembris scriptas, in quibus nulla harum mentio erat, sed plane <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>contrarium; nempe compositis iam rebus in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName>, statuisse re<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>gem omnes suas vires in <placeName ref="l832">Gallos</placeName> missurum, a <placeName ref="l2122">Bollonia</placeName> arcendos, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/><placeName ref="l2122">Bollonisque</placeName> subveniendis.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Fama item pervenit ad nos, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>iam regem munitiones recepisse, copiasque <placeName ref="l832">Gallorum</placeName> profligasse.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Quae utinam vera esset!</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Sed quamprimum rescivero, particeps fies.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>De <placeName ref="l830">Anglis</placeName> caesis, dum caperentur arces a <placeName ref="l832">Gallis</placeName>, fama fuit falsa; <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nam mihi scriptum fuit ab <placeName ref="l15">Andwerpia</placeName> per proditionem accepis<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>se <placeName ref="l832">Gallum</placeName> munitiones.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">De tormentis captis forsan quod relatum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>fuit verum erat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Fama de venturo Caesare ad nos hic frequens est.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Certi <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nihil, quam quod audiveram a viro bono <persName ref="p6733">Iacobum Sturmium</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>huius autorem fuisse.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Pestis apud nos non adeo grassatur, sed <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>febris acutissima, neque movere locum statuo, etiamsi vel m<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>illies adventaret pestis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Infortunii nihil, quod ego sciam, contigit D. <persName ref="p1560">Hopero</persName>, sed <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>valde occupatus est in confundendo Lutheranismo (quod vir <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>fide dignus ad me scripsit) et veritatem plantando.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Agit partes <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>strenui Christiani.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Praelegit publice <placeName ref="l296">Londini</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Frequens habet <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>auditorium.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Laudatur ab omnibus bonis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>D. <persName ref="p1548">Richardi</persName> uxor revaluit ex aegritudine periculosa; per <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>mensem vix fuit spes vitae.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> etiam ex febri revaluit.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Sed nulla spes fere vitae <persName>Pauli</persName> reliqua erat, scripsit D. <persName ref="p1548">Ri<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>chardus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/><persName ref="p1428">Christophero Halesio</persName>, quae nova vobis videntur, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>oro ut communices.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Eius gratia, quod tam sit vobis acceptus, habeo <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>immortales gratias; eidemque ut familiae tuae universae una cum <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>doctorum turba salutem ex me dicito.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Praecor ut Dominus vos in<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>columes diu servat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Tuus, <persName ref="p505">Burcherus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Post literas has scriptas et nondum signatas accepi literas a D. <lb xml:id="p1z45"/><persName ref="p1548">Richardo</persName> et ab <placeName ref="l15">Andwerpia</placeName>, in quibus nulla seditionis mentio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Datae <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>tamen erant <placeName ref="l296">Londini</placeName>, 27 septembris; item aliae <placeName ref="l15">Andwerpiae</placeName>, 5 octobris.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z47"/>De episcopo <placeName ref="l296">Londoniensi</placeName> scripsit D. <persName ref="p1548">Richardus</persName>, quod ductus sit in carcerem, <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>quod pro concione noluit invehere in seditiosos, iussus tamen <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>autoritate regia.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Haec quaeso communices <placeName ref="l830">Anglis</placeName> nostris.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z50"/>D. <persName ref="p1548">Richardus</persName> et uxor iubent te et familiam salvere, cuius valetudo <lb xml:id="p1z51"/>confirmatur indies.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Fama de venturo Caesare <placeName ref="l471">Spiram</placeName> ad <lb xml:id="p1z52"/>kalendas decembres spargitur, sed ab iis, qui desciverunt a fide <lb xml:id="p1z53"/>et qui spem suam in eo col[l]ocant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Depositus est episcopus <placeName ref="l296">Londoni<lb xml:id="p1z54"/>ensis</placeName> sua dignitate; accusabatur ab <persName ref="p1560">Hopero</persName> et alio doctrinae suae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem fürnemmen, wisen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>hern <persName ref="p495">Heinrich Bullinger</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>praedicanten zum Münster, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>mynem gunstigen hern <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>und guͦtem freundt.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
